{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  JUNIP REVIEWS SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Third-party review system integration using Junip platform
  - Displays customer reviews and ratings for products and store
  - Configurable layout options (list or grid display)
  - Multiple review types (all, product, or store reviews)
  - Optional review summary display
  - Customizable number of reviews (3-20)
  - Hidden by default for JavaScript-based rendering
  - Integrates with Junip's review management system
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  JUNIP REVIEWS CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Main container for Junip review system integration
  - junip-review-section: Base styling class for Junip reviews
  - style="display: none": Hidden by default for JavaScript initialization
  - data-layout: Layout preference (list or grid) for Junip system
  - data-reviews-type: Type of reviews to display (all, product, or store)
  - data-show-summary: Boolean flag for review summary visibility
  - data-reviews-count: Number of reviews to display (3-20)
  - All data attributes are passed to Junip's JavaScript system
{% endcomment %}
<span
 class="junip-review-section"
 style="display: none"
 data-layout={{ section.settings.layout }}
 data-reviews-type={{ section.settings.reviewsType }}
 data-show-summary={{ section.settings.showSummary }}
 data-reviews-count={{ section.settings.reviewsCount }}>
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    JUNIP REVIEWS WRAPPER
    =============================================================================
    Inner wrapper for Junip review content
    - junip-review-section-wrapper: Content container for reviews
    - Populated by Junip's JavaScript system
    - Contains actual review content and ratings
    - Handles dynamic content loading and display
  {% endcomment %}
  <span class="junip-review-section-wrapper"></span>
</span>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the Junip reviews section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  Third-party review system integration using Junip platform for customer feedback.
  Provides configurable display options for different review types and layouts.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - Junip review system integration
  - Configurable layout options (list/grid)
  - Multiple review type filtering
  - Optional review summary display
  - Customizable review count limits
  - JavaScript-based content rendering
  
  **SECTION SETTINGS:**
  - layout: Review display layout (list/grid, default: list)
  - reviewsType: Review type filtering (all/product_reviews/store_reviews, default: all)
  - showSummary: Toggle review summary display (default: true)
  - reviewsCount: Number of reviews to show (3-20, default: 10)
  
  **LAYOUT OPTIONS:**
  - list: Vertical list layout for reviews
  - grid: Grid-based layout for review display
  
  **REVIEW TYPE FILTERS:**
  - all: Shows all available reviews
  - product_reviews: Shows only product-specific reviews
  - store_reviews: Shows only general store reviews
  
  **JUNIP INTEGRATION:**
  - Uses data attributes for configuration
  - JavaScript-based content rendering
  - Hidden by default for dynamic loading
  - Integrates with Junip's review management platform
  
  **DISPLAY BEHAVIOR:**
  - Hidden initially (display: none)
  - JavaScript populates content based on settings
  - Responsive design through Junip's system
  - Dynamic content loading and updates
  
  **CONFIGURATION NOTES:**
  - All settings are passed as data attributes
  - Junip JavaScript reads these attributes for configuration
  - Content is rendered client-side by Junip system
  - Theme provides configuration, Junip handles display
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Site & product reviews",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Layout",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "list",
          "label": "List"
        },
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "Grid"
        }
      ],
      "default": "list",
      "info": "The layout of the reviews"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "reviewsType",
      "label": "Type of reviews to show",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "all",
          "label": "All"
        },
        {
          "value": "product_reviews",
          "label": "Product reviews"
        },
        {
          "value": "store_reviews",
          "label": "Store reviews"
        }
      ],
      "default": "all",
      "info": "The type of reviews to show"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "showSummary",
      "label": "Show review summary",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Enabling this will show a review summary at the top of the section"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "reviewsCount",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Number of reviews to show",
      "default": 10,
      "info": "The number of reviews to show"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Site & product reviews",
      "category": "Promotional"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
